          "hint": "6 ÷ 3 = 2. Each girl gets 2 bananas."
        },
        {
          "id": "se4",
          "type": "multiple-choice",
          "prompt": "There are 6 marbles shared equally by 3 boys. How many marbles does each boy get?",
